<title>USA: Alpha-Beta completes Betafectin enrollment.</title>
<headline>Alpha-Beta completes Betafectin enrollment.</headline>
<dateline>WORCESTER, Mass. 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alpha-Beta Technology Inc said that it has completed patient enrollment in the company's Phase III clinical study of Betafectin PGG-glucan for the prevention of serious infections in patients at high-risk for post-operative infections.</p>
<p>The double-blind, placebo-controlled trial has been conducted at 40 clinical sites in the United States and enrolled 1,246 patients.</p>
